      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591621\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100000000102.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">１．</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai13_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591622\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が いちばん <ruby>欲<rp>(</rp><rt>ほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Bây giờ anh/chị muốn cái gì nhất?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>…<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい ケータイが <ruby>欲<rp>(</rp><rt>ほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいです。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi muốn có điện thoại mới.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2． </span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai13_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591623\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>夏休<rp>(</rp><rt>なつやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みに どこ</span><span>へ</span><span> <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きたいですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Nghỉ hè anh/chị muốn đi đâu?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… <ruby>沖縄<rp>(</rp><rt>おきなわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きたいです。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi muốn đi Okinawa.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3． </span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai13_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591624\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>きょうは <ruby>疲<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れましたから、<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も したくないです。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Hôm nay mệt nên chẳng muốn làm gì cả.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… そうですね。 きょうの<ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でしたね。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Đúng thế nhỉ. Cuộc họp hôm nay vất vả quá.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4． </span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai13_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591625\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>週末<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を しますか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Cuối tuần anh/chị sẽ làm gì?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… <ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>どもと <ruby>神戸<rp>(</rp><rt>こうべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>船<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi đi Kobe với con để xem thuyền.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5．</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai13_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591626\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>日本<rp>(</rp><rt>にほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ましたか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị đến Nhật để học gì vậy?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… <ruby>美術<rp>(</rp><rt>びじゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi đến Nhật để học mỹ thuật.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6 ． </span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai13_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"4591627\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>冬休<rp>(</rp><rt>ふゆやす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みは どこか <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きましたか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Nghỉ đông anh/chị đã đi đâu (đó) phải không?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… ええ、<ruby>北海道<rp>(</rp><rt>ほっかいどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ スキーに <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きました。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">… Vâng, tôi đã đi Hokkaido để trượt tuyết.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p></div>",
